// Tenant snapshot age, per instance.
// Backs the "an instance serves a stale tenant snapshot" alert: a suspension or a state change
// reaches an instance only when its snapshot is next confirmed against the catalog, so an age well
// beyond the refresh interval means changes are not arriving. Five minutes is a starting point.
customMetrics
| where name == "tellma.tenancy.catalog.snapshot.age"
| summarize age = max(valueMax) by cloud_RoleInstance, bin(timestamp, 5m)
| where age > 300
